{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:54:57.599666+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9634686bcf5e02114fd897511b58d066fe9e23e6f4a7a923b43a9d869d76a5a6","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:estim1 of arXiv:2412.03450, 'On intermediate levels of nested occupancy scheme in random environment generated by stick'] Assume that Assumptions $A$ and $B$ hold. Then there exists $D>0$ such that
