Then $\mathbf P_t$ minimizes $\Phi_t$ over $\mathscr{P}_+(K,d)$. Conversely, every minimizer of $\Phi_t$ over $\mathscr{P}_+(K,d)$ admits a certificate (equation eq:sdp.certificate of the paper).","status":"unverified"}

