{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:48:35.773852+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_96ae7f993db51771f8f452206d909b3858c5aa4b91db7801e9932903c4e124e6","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thmpmf of arXiv:2411.09257, 'Iterated Generalized Counting Process and its Extensions'] The state probabilities of IGCP are given by
