\end{align*}
where $\dimh$ and $\dimp$ stand for the Hausdorff and packing dimensions, respectively.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:36:23.130987+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_96b77d74e8785a0a3b5de5b56f0f66db1cac7053031cf6e57558435093df242f","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Cor DoubIntCond of arXiv:2506.18207, 'Cartan's Path Development, the Logarithmic Signature and a Conjecture of Lyons-Sidorova'] Under the assumption of Theorem (thm:DoubInt of the paper), one has
