{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:38:04.515727+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_96e86357da669276fd88744ef7aae65aa58f1351fe6b19d16719dbe50858f577","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition eq:almost_linear_giant of arXiv:2607.18011, 'From local giants to locality in long-range percolation'] \thlabel{prop:almost_linear}
