{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:15:16.652383+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_96ea8520f983e2c271dff9ef5d29a0d0a938011691003305ad48590ccfe80eb3","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 2 of arXiv:2608.30752, '2608.30752'] Let \((M,g)\) be a closed Riemannian manifold, let \(u_0:M\to S\) satisfy
the filling hypothesis, and let
\(q\in\mathcal Q^1(X_0)\) be Jenkins--Strebel. With the notation above,
