{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:55:57.007573+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_97e51f9c0c6216fe911b4b512378dbb29460935b58db6daad7adb0a37f0e7acd","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 1 of arXiv:2609.02808, 'Minimizers of Laplace eigenvalues under a lower curvature bound'] Let $D>0$ and let $\varphi\colon[0,D]\to[0,\infty)$ be continuous, positive on $(0,D)$,
