{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:51:33.330120+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9815a92671f524f8d8363992a7b57a516d41831e8f3b4be687e00b2d121b6af7","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop Splev-cc of arXiv:2608.28504, 'Global $\bm\infty$-categories and global Thom spectra'] The global $\infty$-category ${\mathpalette\ulhelper{{\mathfrak d\kern-.25pt}{\mathfrak S\kern-.5pt\mathfrak p}}}\hbox{\rule[-2pt]{0pt}{0pt}}_\textup{lvl}$ is globally presentable.
    \begin{proof}
