{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:14:46.376000+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_98c0fb608b0d19ebc44abf56d3033fd0115403913d13636bbb79df0f70151a93","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem of arXiv:2608.10415, 'Continuous random variables'] The negative binomial law $c_{mp}$ has the following properties:
