{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:36:16.067583+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_990f5bbed1e2ce70e69a0bc97ac8cfcf5d1acdd75c19c82e56acab8cc742e4bd","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:nonlinear_est of arXiv:2606.28575, 'Global smooth solutions by high mode Lie-Transport noise for Logarithmically Hyperdissipat'] For all $g$ verifying (hp_correction of the paper) and every $\xi, \omega \in H^{-1/4}_g$, denoting $v=K[ \xi], \ u = K[\omega]$ it holds 
