    where $\mathfrak{c}^s:\mathfrak{X} \to [-\infty,\infty)$ is defined by $\mathfrak{c}^s(\xi) = -\infty$ for all $\xi \notin \pmb{\xi}^{s,b}$, and for $\xi \in \pmb{\xi}^{s,b} = \{\xi_i\}_{i \in \mathcal I^s}$,
    \begin{equation}
    \mathfrak{c}^s \left(\xi_i \right)=
