            -\sum_{j=i+1}^{-1}W^{\xi_{j}}\left(\mathfrak{a}_{\xi_{j}},s;\mathfrak{a}_{\xi_{j+1}},s\right)+W^{\xi_{i}}\left(\mathfrak{a}_{\xi_{i+1}},s;0,0\right)& i \in \mathbb{Z}_{< 0},
