{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:42:47.761791+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9962f5cd6b023fd51b6d6e3813a053c7055f407f7cbca70d32a7bf1442898720","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 3 of arXiv:2604.12317, 'Weak solution for distribution dependent SDEs driven by L\'{e}vy noise'] (i) For any \( \alpha \in(1,2],~p>1 \) and \( \beta, \gamma \geq 0 \), for all \( f \in \mathbf{H}^{\beta,p} \), we have
