{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:13:31.964262+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_99dfc63ac59e534363a7e9f00a5fabc0121f9bb3d352e8ffd421d324356e5191","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:decay of arXiv:2506.23062, 'Shifted Composition IV\@: \\ Toward Ballistic Acceleration for Log-Concave Sampling'] For the processes defined in \S(ssec:harnack_overview of the paper),
