{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:42:39.074589+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9ad27f6ac11ecc0b070032c8cb8650df431c3a603a700614e076a362d1069499","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 6. lem: aging, convergence of traps for random electrical networks of arXiv:2412.08236, 'Aging and sub-aging for Bouchaud trap models on resistance metric spaces'] Under Assumption (1. assum: aging, random version of the paper), it holds that 
