{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:32:19.922231+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9adf62949e7fbb03f1d5e3a5ecad2c9d8180c4f2e8c67a4d2b448470ebdd238f","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 13 of arXiv:2608.02927, 'Thinning Operation via the Poisson-F\"ollmer Process'] Let $G$ be as in \eqref{eq:functG} and $h:\R \rightarrow \R$ differentiable function. Then, we have
