{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:09:49.823230+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9ae71380f2bf6bcc70eb8bb32475bdad10fc1bdd0a8d85c2402242696e914001","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 25 of arXiv:2609.03070, 'Variants of order semicontinuity in Banach lattices'] The following conditions are equivalent:
