{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:56:17.361472+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9ae87f12e6fe70ca339ff7325218f4377fb2f940c1c8f3fd2e146ad5916a5f73","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:contraction of arXiv:2605.16244, 'Analysis of a twisted Bose--Einstein Markov chain with applications to sampling Catalan st'] If $v\in\mathbb R^k$ satisfies $\sum_av_a=0$, then
