{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:57:28.230874+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9ae8828771b3ba443111f64b5b6ca522111fef6cfaed910653836b781d6267c3","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 22 of arXiv:2607.18104, '2607.18104'] Let $(\omega_v)_{v \in \Z^2}$ be an $(N,k)$-periodic environment for some $N \in \N$ and with $k=k(N)\in \lbr N -1\rbr$. 
