{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:21:10.889714+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9b6f2a3402bacc2c07039f7b7daad0e9f98f67f8083ce7de9170b0167a80babf","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 46 (Cluster frequencies) of arXiv:2504.02435, 'Poisson-Voronoi percolation in higher rank'] Let $\lambda>0$ and $p\in(0,1]$. 
