{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:58:10.025708+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9c02a0d0f92167acb28d497f67764ee0765149d84c547141571d1efd796047e1","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition eq:Bhat of arXiv:2607.19844, 'Binomial probabilities at a fixed distance from the mode:\\ size-biasing and the complete '] Let $\widehat B_n$ be the Appell sequence defined, for all $n\ge0$, by
