{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:57:28.719841+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9c47f6fc63c09b430371b8df7f62dde11fa6882177959b1f1f740ff8faeb4455","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 17 of arXiv:2609.01166, 'Nonparametric inference for density-dependent McKean--Vlasov diffusions'] Under assumptions~\ref{ass:potential} and~\ref{ass:coefficient}, every candidate density satisfies
