in the coordinates of the cylinder and where $\xi$ is the $\mathfrak{g}$-valued white noise w.r.t. to the area form $\Psi_*\sigma$.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:25:49.870359+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9c59d41c3ed9f0fb63555c54b4ca89a0e75a827a1e33c6b408528328d4c48398","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 11 of arXiv:2609.02050, '2609.02050'] Let $D$ be a diagram that avoids the configurations in Figure~\ref{fig-upper} and let $C^{(1)},\ldots,C^{(m)}$ be all the diagrams $C=(C_1,C_2,\ldots,C_n)$ with $|C_j|=|D_j|$ for $j\in[n]$ and ${\bf x}^{C}={\bf x}^a$, where ${\bf x}^a$ is a monomial in $\chi_{D}({\bf x})$. For simplicity, write ${\bf y}^{(a)}={y}^{F_{led}^{C^{(a)}}}$  Then we have the following results:
