{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:31:20.862404+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9c5e413ae4f17161231605ad71fdb41974f24c3b898fe4866d6645afe8dd1086","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 17 of arXiv:2506.10817, 'On the Weak Error for Local Stochastic Volatility Models'] Assume the setting of Theorem \ref{thm_condExp_err} and recall $\hE^\eps_\delta$ from Definition \ref{Def_hEepsdelta}. 
