{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:19:46.234008+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9cb521a33f0f6f99e2497475e21412dbfd65631b37da60605c293055b8d3bb1b","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Cor 67 of arXiv:2507.08909, 'Annealed almost periodic entropy'] Let $\tau$ be a tracial state of $\A$, let $\l$ be its GNS representation, and let $\phi \in \B(\A,\rmM_k)_+$.
\begin{enumerate}
