{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:58:01.573707+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9cfb927a60f837831f9c209ce68c199ec03dec867ff2e770bdae6862bb150f1a","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 41 of arXiv:2608.27307, '2608.27307'] Under Assumption~\ref{ass:basic}, let $E_*$ be a regular right edge in the sense of Definition~\ref{def:reg_r_edge}. Fix $E\in\R$ and let
        \begin{align}
