{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:01:39.501729+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9d26f763fd5da7ce0c966cf542fe68c2792321a5ab9a1ec30bf45d0441a2b9ee","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma sphere_to_gaussian_CDF of arXiv:2607.22480, 'Distinguishability threshold for random geometric graphs'] Let $k\geq 3$ be a positive integer and let $t$ be any real number. Then, we have
