where $M_x=\binom{x+3}{3}$ for $x\geq0$ and $M_x=0$ for $x<0$.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:25:12.194111+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9df09c8cc6259b9968e114f312d23d6bbea3188f9d83831d743cf414a3e6ea41","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 5 (\hspace{-0.05em}{{\cite[Theorem~1) of arXiv:2510.22783, 'Universality of Cutoff for Riffle Shuffling'] {hush2005concentration}}}]

