{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:24:20.640993+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9dfbb69fa8e8479d21d281ca4d36aad914648c50757d82eb029a22842dad3279","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem of arXiv:2608.10415, 'Continuous random variables'] The cumulants have the following properties:
