{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:37:51.458788+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9e000e4584f64170eac2ba3c2babf00bcb1cc4f5ff62e5185aa3b468ecb77c2e","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 42 of arXiv:2604.03777, 'Equilibrium fluctuations for a multi-species particle system with long jumps'] It holds
