{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:57:16.073615+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9e7dac3a6e03ecf48337eed19ad51f77e3b6a55abafa07514baed67c6376233c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:OPRE-main-induction of arXiv:2507.00329, 'Oriented bond-site percolation in random environment and contact processes with periodic r'] For every sufficiently large $\lambda$ depending on $\gamma,\, L_0,\, \mu,\, \beta$, we have
