{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:46:26.252681+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9ed0fe737d558b6acd67f73ff8a3f673f0919d6476e325713feecd8bb8f09bbc","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemm 10 of arXiv:2605.23292, 'Second-order Poincaré inequalities and localization on the Poisson space'] (localization of mixed moments of scores)
