\begin{equation}
     \mathbb P(\mathcal{D}^{\mu} \in \cdot) = \lim_{t\to\infty}\mathbb P(\sum_{k = 1}^{n(t)}\delta_{\{\chi_{k}(t) - M_{t} \}} \in \cdot | M_{t} \ge \mu t).
\end{equation} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

