{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:49:49.201921+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a0d61440c0de1eed9416e8d0380537f4252d9ffb23f39ec418d2a30433844bbe","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 13 of arXiv:2604.26819, 'Sharp One-\!Dimensional Sub-Gaussian Comparison in Convex Order'] Let $ n \in\bbZ_{\ge2} $ and $s\ge0$. 
