{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:26:00.619251+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a0ef10da07cf5aaf4a92adb394b99e082f9338097ee95cd7bbf7e311adf64dcf","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 2 of arXiv:2511.00679, 'Stochastic solutions to abstract telegraph-type equations involving fractional dynamics'] Let $\alpha\in(0,\frac12].$ The unique solution to the problem \eqref{eq:fractelcbis}-\eqref{eq:fractelc2bis}, has the following stochastic  representation
