{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:16:46.713045+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a163305bfd4d8903be71a00e0e8d9378b0c49a01d828ded87f8acfedb388caa0","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma preliminary of arXiv:2411.18775, 'Limit Theorems for the Dynamical Foundation of the Fractional Brownian Motion and Related '] Under Assumptions of Theorem~(Thm of the paper)~(i) consider the Ornstein-Uhlenbeck processes given by~(equation eq:OUprocess of the paper). Then we have
