then
\begin{equation}
    \lim_{t\downarrow 0}\frac{\mathbb{P}^{x_1}[\sigma_{B_1}\leq t]}{\mathbb{P}^{x_2}[\sigma_{B_2}\leq t]}=0. 
\end{equation}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-09-07T12:18:10.807815+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a18aaf5d59e8afaa26db26f0e5315095e38f77556cf539cd77b56e3233bec600","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 15 of arXiv:2512.19517, 'Spiking and Resetting'] For any $s>0$ and $\eta>0$, we have that 
