    \end{equation*}
    where $C,c$ may depend on $T$ and $\delta$.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:36:16.061146+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a1dae873b459fd9a0b86068dadc7ba47c2dbd65cd0a817fc3e9b8a11c38199db","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:ruin-condition of arXiv:2606.28031, 'Insurance risk models in a heterogeneous time-dependent population: scaling limits and rui'] Under Assumption~(A:hyp LLN for V of the paper), if
