{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:27:25.785227+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a1ebe7313f4e2cd34a847e080bce7d4a0093e2cfdb474a6c717e7cd17f5e0f3f","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Cor statequiv-annulus-bound of arXiv:2605.08052, 'Rapid phase ordering of Ising dynamics on $\mathbb Z^2$'] For any $B \in \mathscr{B}_k$ and any $R \in \mathscr{R}_{k-1}(B)$, 
