{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:07:56.655851+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a1f64e650a4090c46228efa72d9d54494c169c08d76094eeda5e376ff735e886","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem th:contrex of arXiv:2411.04690, 'Asymptotic distribution of the derivative of the taut string accompanying Wiener process'] Let $\lambda>1$, $r>0$ and $\varphi(u)\ge e^{\lambda r u}$ for all sufficiently large
