\end{equation} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:06:21.751742+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a3169c5d7d556be35ea758a43ce7cfcb9213fd6d387a20b1d0ddc69d07c7bb81","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 52 of arXiv:2607.21374, 'Local structure at the maximum and sharp persistence asymptotics of rough fractional Brown'] There is a unique probability measure \(\pi_H\) on \(\mathbb R_+\) such
