    \nabla \int_{\ensuremath{\mathbb{R}}^d} e^{-W(x - y) - \frac{1}{\kappa}U(y)}\nu_0(y)^{\frac{\kappa - 1}{\kappa}} dy = - \int_{\ensuremath{\mathbb{R}}^d} \nabla W(x - y) e^{-W(x - y) - \frac{1}{\kappa}U(y)}\nu_0(y)^{\frac{\kappa - 1}{\kappa}} dy.

