{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:09:34.498281+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a40088b59f81a513f55c91c94d5c581fc9b9df59beb16e5c6a06ed038c6887bc","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm Base Point Independence of arXiv:2505.14762, 'Multiple radial SLE($\kappa$) and quantum Calogero-Sutherland system'] Let $\Gamma = \mathscr{P}(z_i, z_j)$ be a Pochhammer contour, and let $p_0 = \Gamma(0)$ denote its base point. Then the integral
