{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:51:26.590344+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a40d7dede71e23f14ed3378bf0952ce15362197135ff40e8f0d71825920dec64","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:harmonizable of arXiv:2606.02003, 'Higher-Order Multifractional Stable Motion:\\ Definition and Fundamental Properties'] Let $\widetilde{M}_\alpha$ be a complex isotropic S$\alpha$S random
