{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:52:57.734486+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a47c6b15be25883146c759ca8debe10087222485c66ed2f6f2837e8f0d575ad8","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 18 of arXiv:2609.02755, 'The Sharp Rate of Probabilistically Strong Convergence to the KPZ Equation'] For $p \in [2, \infty)$, we have that
