{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:57:30.985830+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a47d1edd5f324f5d3d4dde9e05dc8c7240e018f5726b34cd33acd60925a4b75e","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 16 (Intrinsic primitive--Fock unitary) of arXiv:2608.12492, 'Weak Limits of Wiener Chaos: Primitive--Fock Classification and Hilbert--Stein Extraction'] For every $q\ge1$, symmetric evaluation of primitive blocks extends
