{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:51:12.727295+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a4db5ec8cd7bd0078ef9b712e1b032a64a756bc846dcd7eec643550deb386226","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 15 of arXiv:2605.02002, 'Glauber dynamics for random field Ising models on bounded degree graphs and MLSI'] (\cite{chen2025rapid2}, Proposition 3.3)
