{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:37:20.363003+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a554bb21c8dacd229417262eca7e77c1af4356b3efefe727104b108a4adadcd8","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma L:ZS of arXiv:2411.13257, '\titlefont \vspace{-5ex} Inference by Multiple Identical Observers'] For $F \in {{\mathcal F}_W}$ and $y \in {\mathcal Z}$, 
