{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:41:54.363003+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a67a241b9e67e43687e9e74d8cda7a9548a94d2560221ecf61121179fe7ac24a","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor:interpolation of arXiv:2412.01645, 'Regularisation by Gaussian rough path lifts of fractional Brownian motions'] Let $0\leq s<t\leq 1$. Let $\gamma>1-2H$. Let $f\in\mathcal{H}$ such that   $\mathop{\mathrm{supp}} f\subset[s,t]$ and the restriction of $f$ to $[s,t]$ belongs to $\mathcal{C}^\gamma$.
