{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:04:55.827567+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a6d7240b07d30205b6861c70aedce7822edbb6c900fbb21107401d7f9d132049","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma of arXiv:2607.24640, 'The Yang-Mills measure on surfaces via Morse theory'] Let $\blacksquare$ be an admissible flow rectangle. Then,  for every $\Psi\in \mathcal{C}^0(G)$, we have 
