{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:38:08.428503+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a7130cd8db7dad1e0c15ec354d821226bcebe33fcfb909f66db505aafa623ba7","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma estimate for gprime at wm of arXiv:2609.02073, 'Existence of closed non-planar $p$-elasticae'] Let $\gamma \in (1,2)$ and $(\lambda,C^2)\in S^0$ such that Proposition~(prop: wm around S2:2 of the paper) holds. Then 
