is strictly increasing.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:49:05.516792+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a7f5f4e3516fd55bed5e8c2b7dbb323ba92c88e0611bf2474a978157124ecbfe","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem l-v-lemma of arXiv:2601.19145, 'Stochastic Persistence in Infinite Dimensions'] For $V$ as in (equation def-of-V-for-SPDE of the paper) we have $V \in \tilde{\mathcal{D}}^{ext}_+(\mathcal{M}_+)$ (see (spde-tilde-domain of the paper)) and
