{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:29:35.103397+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a8889c8760008eb7215c3f4144c746a40bf72750e9ec82cf77af99f7b63a3d20","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 40 of arXiv:2609.03821, 'Condensation and Metastability in the Supercritical Two-Species Zero-Range Process via Res'] Recall \eqref{eq:a-def}. For fixed $k\ge1$ and
