{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:17:33.989794+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a8aa4719a316a75ca9cd3a2ec17d9934e01b09dc8a98ad51b959ef6acb4dfeb4","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 20 of arXiv:2609.03386, 'Twisted Gradient Flow Approach to Vegetation-Rainfall-Bushfire Interactions Model'] We have 

