{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:48:47.299964+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a8e5753ee32cbf419a00157782fd7d0ffdc6bfc9b30a5bf60a11c9aaeef45661","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop geographic ineq slicing map of arXiv:2604.21663, 'Large deviations for non-irreducible Markov chains on Euclidean spaces'] \begin{enumerate}
