{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:39:11.667382+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a97c265b4685479ad49fadc5b4910520b2e394a1d4438edf29ef7688149e3c64","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 12 of arXiv:2608.04644, 'Khinchin's and Chung's Laws of the Iterated Logarithm at Time Zero for the Linear Stochast'] Suppose that Condition \ref{hypo} holds, $H<1$,   {$0\le\gamma<1$}, and $\beta+\gamma<2+H$.
