{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:38:13.631954+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a9ffd2f7e3b60b8992e562b634edbec8ce5004f0fa127378309f8feeda7f5840","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 19 of arXiv:2609.00598, 'Supercritical mean--field limit for magnetized Hamiltonian dynamics'] Let $X_{N}^{0}\in  \Delta_{N}^{c}$ and $\Xi_{N}^{0}\in \mathbb{R}^{2N}$, 
