{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:47:40.719590+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_aa42850ae9da00c81bd5d31d8ab943bc8e4176da7c835a5391a6247e177b134c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm-order of arXiv:2604.17170, 'CaTherine wheels from trees and Liouville quantum gravity'] Let $f$ be as in Theorem~(thm-lqg-wheel of the paper).
