{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:40:21.316403+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_aa4b60df9ca44bf07ede3edec66c5ed8945eceeb95842a4720119b07d328f434","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 2 of arXiv:2604.09248, '\bfseries Limit laws for longest edges in empty region graphs'] Assume the same set-up as in Theorem \ref{th:PoisConv}. Then, for any $t\geq 2$,
