{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T21:02:38.602736+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_aa875ee6c1f49996e504c44f018f1f91ceb919d03e5d51da86c3988643aebdce","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 41 of arXiv:2607.07283, 'Multi-time Markov renewal chains and stratified renewal theorems'] Assume that $I_s-q_{\zerod}$ is invertible. The coefficients of $\psi=(e_0-q)^{(-1)}$ are determined recursively by

