{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:07:15.774791+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ab5eb243951728d93710558c337fc2500aef914dd81fc95a9e6841e7655413f9","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:mtfact of arXiv:2608.05089, 'Correlation decay in area-tilted line ensembles'] Suppose that $\Omega$ is a topological space and that $(\nu_N)_{N \in \mathbb{N}}$ are probability measures on $\Omega$
