{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:58:09.040030+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ab92c6fb19a51be2923b9ff13f6f8ce79f795e6ded55abdba8d62602126febe2","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 4 of arXiv:2606.26619, 'Ergodicity of stochastic reaction-diffusion equations on unbounded domains driven by space'] Let $u$ be the solution of equation (\ref{3.1}) with initial value $f$. 
