{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:41:29.041111+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ac3feaa4b674568bda2d2cdd6fb03bcf66175043710978609f32c5c7814491f3","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 3 (cf.\ Section 2 of \cite{Chen2024}) of arXiv:2608.26598, 'Pinching cones for positive isotropic curvature in dimensions seven and eight'] If $S$ evolves by \eqref{eq:pullback-ode}, then
    \begin{equation}
