{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:33:01.793204+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_acb8422874ddc699e48024599d192417f79016ed14971378f031c255823119e2","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 72 (Renormalisation of the $\Phi^4_3$ model) of arXiv:2605.14630, '2605.14630'] Define the energy by 
