{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:47:32.880127+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_acd2d58057cdb699963a89d5ecd955db46f520af12906036037995d186d2585e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 13 of arXiv:2609.02478, 'Improved Weyl bounds on short intervals'] Let $k\ge3$, let $1\le |h|\le N$, and let
