{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:39:11.673736+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ada9838ade20a4a6f38473503d83ede204c3d35fe3c28eb843326276c092381b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 9 of arXiv:2608.04853, 'Minimal-Norm Extensions of Stationary Kernels on Subgroups of Locally Compact Abelian Grou'] Let $H \subseteq G$ be a closed subgroup. Given a stationary kernel $k$ on $G$, the spectral density $\hat{k}_H:\hat{H} \to \R$ of the restricted kernel is given by 
