{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:42:08.463239+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ae031839a601a5c8adf7336b06254c241f271fd132987443ef221f18c639d14c","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma eq:Lcal_hatH0 of arXiv:2511.15893, 'On a Class of Dynamical Poisson-Voronoi Tessellations'] The Laplace transform of $\hat{H}^2$ under the Palm probability measure $\mathbb{P}^0_{\mathcal V }$ is 

