    where $\kappa^\star(\Sigma) := \eigmax{D^{1/2} \Sigma D^{1/2}}$ with $D := \diagonal{\Sigma\inv}$ is the ATE constant for $\Sigma$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

