{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:29:27.958730+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ae6fe7f7d1e7681033bc02f0c906b39f90449927be752ce748a705f31d5b21e1","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 13 of arXiv:2608.24675, 'Towards Liouville Quantum Gravity on fractals'] We call a random measure $\nu^\gamma$ on $K$ a \emph{Liouville Quantum Gravity measure} (LQG measure) if
