   for every nonnegative measurable functional $F$ on $H^{-\varepsilon}(K)\times K$.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:24:59.497926+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ae7028a324cf0b0b3c17e1a6ec19e117826d265434f0b67c04b57f95b89806a6","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 15 of arXiv:2605.09706, 'A dyadic construction of a three-dimensional attractive point interaction Markov family'] Fix $t>0$, and $x\in\R^3\setminus\{0\}$. Then,
