{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-09-07T12:18:10.807501+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ae9d551a1390175d00b43b08f87eeca8659fdf601c348ff2fc5410a9a0bff01d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 12 of arXiv:2512.19517, 'Spiking and Resetting'] \cite[R\'{e}nyi theorem]{DV02} 

