{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:18:19.443014+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_aee4f67f443efadad46f7ecf277bc2c94f734abb609b45b097985816ee9e0f10","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def:nonbacktracking of arXiv:2508.17838, '\bf Edge Universality for Inhomogeneous Random Matrices'] \begin{itemize}
    \item[(i)] 

For $n\ge 2$,  we define  $V_n$ as the $n$-th non-backtracking power of $H$,
\begin{equation}
