{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:36:23.124073+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b08047d672f99b55288a9b7e33fbb8c0ec1269cb4d2e5581685df25e8a3545f5","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem definingODEsystem of arXiv:2506.18207, 'Cartan's Path Development, the Logarithmic Signature and a Conjecture of Lyons-Sidorova'] The pair $(\rho^\lambda_t,\varphi^\lambda_t)$ satisfies the following ODE system:
