{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:26:00.619391+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b171388ca9c0a729cc3e2206a531a5985bbc40b00ff76c947331ef12c61ebc48","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 4 of arXiv:2511.00679, 'Stochastic solutions to abstract telegraph-type equations involving fractional dynamics'] Let $\{B(t):t\geq 0\}$ be the standard Brownian motion. We get that
