{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:36:04.989682+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b178f99111ec2eca8e21222abdd0f0967626ad6a6cfbf243ff990d51f352c936","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 5 of arXiv:2604.00882, 'On some extensions of generalized counting processes'] The probabilities ${p}^\nu_k(t)=\Prob\{N(\mathcal{L}^\nu(t))=k\}$ satisfy the following  equation
