{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:04:55.821546+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b1a3d81b1524363b20f38ff3f140ffa593d9c2f489baca9a43a30ada5d306fbc","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary c:brownian-maximum of arXiv:2607.24640, 'The Yang-Mills measure on surfaces via Morse theory'] The stochastic process $t\in\mathbb{R}_+\mapsto \widetilde{\mathfrak{W}}_0(t)\in\mathfrak{g}$ verifies the following properties:
