{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:52:05.692998+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b1f7ea145782c811e3d8b9a445798a32183b526238ac92fb7d2e0cda2862cbbd","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop p:3.8nn of arXiv:2602.21277, 'A Limit in Law for the Cover Time and Last Visited Vertex of Wired Planar Domains'] For all $u \geq 0$, as $n \to \infty$ followed by $k \to \infty$ and finally $\delta \to 0$,
