{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:31:57.880076+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b1f9942bcdd6e5b2ac529ec94b7d0130912772cbefa4ab495671c2436784b3e0","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:multidimcontraction-structure of arXiv:2510.13659, 'On the energy image density conjecture of Bouleau and Hirsch'] Let $(X,d,\mu,\mathcal{E}_p, \mathcal{F}_p, \Gamma_p)$ be a $p$-Dirichlet structure and let $n \in \mathbb{N}$.
