{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:52:17.583679+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b2be80175f85460200b8577ab29724cf270dd1e1fe89b5d9dc62de9a54e6d676","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem Thm.Comparison of arXiv:2411.15485, '\bf\Large Stochastic Volterra Equations for Local Times of Spectrally Positive L\'evy Proc'] For  $b_1,b_2,\zeta_1, \zeta_2\geq 0$ and $i=1,2$, let $\xi_i$ be a spectrally positive L\'evy process with L\'evy triplet $(b_i,c,\nu)$. 
