{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:53:10.210693+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b2f157a7835003d692429cbf041b09f6399491b8a1d34735c3559fb48cd0b6af","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defn eq:vec of arXiv:2608.29018, 'Sharp Restricted Isometry Thresholds for\\ Global Minima of Rank-Restricted Matrix LASSO'] For $\delta\ge0$ and an integer $k\ge1$, we write $A\in\operatorname{rip}(\delta,k)$
