{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:10:07.474460+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b38d2fc5717ed88afc0da9f26b60fbc717f9a1a00091e0cc60b406fe11cd453e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma eq:U-inside of arXiv:2607.27613, 'Regularized Bulk Universality versus Bounded-Disorder Nonuniversality\\for Annealed Comple'] \label[lemma]{lem:semicircle-log-potential}
For \(\left\lverty\right\rvert\le\sqrt2\),
\begin{equation}
 U(y)=\frac{y^2}{2}-\frac12-\frac12\log2.
\end{equation}
For \(\left\lverty\right\rvert>\sqrt2\),
\begin{equation}
 U'(y)=y-\operatorname{sgn}(y)\sqrt{y^2-2}.
\end{equation}
