{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:35:10.799739+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b3ea39e4d36c6a33963ee097ea31de27351b82c6678d8d5cbb80e10bc33b6a70","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemme 71 of arXiv:2604.00635, 'Large deviations of the periodic Toda chain'] If $\ups_j = -\vsg $, $\vsg \in \{\pm\}$, then one has the upper bound

