{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:13:49.973551+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b548037bd4af1621272e8af2ac9902420d35501dfa43389a6005b85800b3b3a1","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma eq:Phi2 of arXiv:2411.07157, 'Rough differential equations in the flow approach'] Let $T\in(0,1]$ be as in Proposition~(eq:prop1 of the paper). 
