{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:01:54.285253+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b592605f4939a7999dd3b7ee069231b1f3d8b8ba93ea1049b9c8ceb4c146e26d","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemma2 of arXiv:2411.01731, '$L^2$-Wasserstein contraction of modified Euler schemes for SDEs with high diffusivity and'] Assume that $({\bf A}_0)$, $({\bf H}_1)$,  $({\bf H}_4)$, $({\bf H}_5)$ hold, and suppose further $({\bf A}_5)$ in case  $\beta $ given in $({\bf H}_5)$
