    \mathbb{P}\mleft[\mleft|\widehat{\mathsf{N}}_G(X) - \mathbb{E}\mleft[\widehat{\mathsf{N}}_G(X)\mright]\mright| > n^{\mathsf{v}-1.5+\zeta}\mright] \leq \exp\mleft(-cn^\zeta\mright).
