{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:39:12.200932+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b5ae8c9ff3bdfafa75f266230861be506daa0dd43f3ff599dd88b7cdad83fa7b","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def_Z of arXiv:2412.07258, 'Permuton limit of a generalization of the Mallows and $k$-card-minimum models'] For fixed $i,j \in \{0,1, 2, \ldots, n\}$ we denote
