{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:18:13.261607+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b61d4d4a80d6c55bcd8018f23440633a4ba1fdd691e391e4cbebe5f6203f884d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma stestimate-kv of arXiv:2507.10545, 'KPZ equation from a class of nonlinear SPDEs in infinite volume'] \fsp Fix any {\small$\e>0$}, and recall the setting of Lemma (lemma:stestimate-rep of the paper). Suppose that {\small$\mathfrak{f}_{\j}$} satisfy the following constraints:

