{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:58:40.873745+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b7c3a96cebd80972e6b210f2db5815eea40a6c2beb24ca9a93973c17b829c5ac","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition discreteW of arXiv:2605.10617, 'Logarithmic scaling of selective sweep curves:\\ from tents to houses'] Let  
