{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:30:50.735317+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b9e42b02561017988c53724622ce993a4062e68c62ecd564e85a93783197897f","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def: general renormalised potential of arXiv:2503.24372, 'A criterion on the free energy for log-Sobolev inequalities in mean-field particle systems'] For any $\psi \in \bbH$, the renormalised potential is 
