\tilde{c}_{i_0,i_1,\cdots, i_k}=\frac{\prod_{j=1}^k(2i_j-1)!!}{i_0!i_1!\cdots i_k!}
\end{eqnarray}
and the double factorial notation is given in ((double_factorial of the paper)).","status":"unverified"}

