{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:37:25.924902+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ba2f0aa203014e6ff3d2639874211f716f7e96187daa3bc72e052c6a0db17276","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 24 (Cyclotomic-local knot germ) of arXiv:2608.29585, '2608.29585'] Fix a zero-framed knot $K$ and an integer $n\ge2$.  For every $d\ge1$
