{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:38:04.517968+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bb5bcd84cc50782b8f3f587709132c136e94f8528935bc833a1e4e986f22cd80","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma eq:useful_bound_1 of arXiv:2607.18011, 'From local giants to locality in long-range percolation'] \thlabel{lem:useful_bounds}
