{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:38:11.737131+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bc35c02f66551eb4b6201407c716c2c968ae503b33e88457097bbaa9dac44a21","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemma_G_large of arXiv:2504.00512, 'Localization-delocalization transition for a random block matrix model at the edge'] In the setting of (mix of the paper), let $z=E+\mathrm{i} \eta \in \bf D(\tau)$ with $\eta\gtrsim N^{-1/3}$ and $\eta/\im m (z) \sim N^{-\varepsilon_g}$ for a small constant ${\varepsilon}_g\in\left({0,\delta_A/4}\right)$. 
