{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:35:10.793690+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bc592301a93b8081bd3310d78c7deb1027dba1842e6b3dc3f7e94da17673795d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemme 28 of arXiv:2604.00635, 'Large deviations of the periodic Toda chain'] One has the upper bound

