    Moreover the hidden constant $C(T)$ depends only on $\sup_{t\in [0,T]}\|\theta\|^2_{\ell^2}$, and not on the particular choice of frequency localization ($n>1$) of the noise (c.f. (hyp_noise of the paper)). (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

