{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:29:00.764074+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bde45a2b4eccf4c0bd467a6fdaea7ff618491507282e3d33ac796ebcd6256299","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 12 (Properties of the signature) of arXiv:2512.04646, '\textbf{Canonical Rough Path over Tempered Fractional Brownian Motion: Existence, Construc'] Let $H > 1/4$ and $\lambda > 0$.
\begin{enumerate}[label=(\alph*)]
