{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:54:57.619980+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_be0d8ae045120c4c2645b3638cce12b21747f56dd37f4e2664a4e5094d77b612","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemma6 of arXiv:2412.03450, 'On intermediate levels of nested occupancy scheme in random environment generated by stick'] For each $k \in \mathbb{N}$, let $y_k : [0,\infty) \to \mathbb{R}
