{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:41:11.643552+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_be16fb68b93a459663bd693623b0b2191156c7cab4c431c508e5651377844091","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma p-moment-X_m of arXiv:2411.13923, 'Harmonic analysis of multiplicative chaos \\ Part I: the proof of Garban-Vargas conjecture'] For any $\gamma\in(0,\sqrt{2})$, any $t\in[0,1]$ and any $p>0$, we have
