{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T21:02:38.603128+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bfd8500d35f6fd0c93dd2b5dfd70bc2aca37bfe92ffa83fbd12ff7723784d307","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 46 of arXiv:2607.07283, 'Multi-time Markov renewal chains and stratified renewal theorems'] For $n\geq1$ and $k\in\Z^d$, put

