{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:53:51.342011+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bfd8f5ec388c02c4d9f3debc1de14082f5b8f2a00dcb956cd427bcc7098da352","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:first of arXiv:2605.05904, 'Schr\"odinger's problem with constraints'] Under Assumptions~(a:main of the paper) and (ass:f of the paper), the SDE 
\begin{equation}

