{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:37:20.365704+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c015c69c3c5900abc3b61e2621cef12d43bd000e08dbeabf72fa6caec1790d36","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defn eq:-19 of arXiv:2411.13403, 'Path weighting method for spot sensitivities and its variance reduction'] We denote by $\hat{Z}$ the vector obtained by reflecting the first
