{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:46:26.258301+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c03b597b747d610fa4e6509f6eb0802a81818f4e0be6469f32f951385ab77102","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 77 of arXiv:2605.23308, 'Convergence rate estimates for semigroups and heat kernels associated with resistance form'] \quad\par
