{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:32:19.937134+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c055b252135615b186079898338927085b7ff107a3d56bf75547dd00d855ab02","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 15 of arXiv:2608.02927, 'Thinning Operation via the Poisson-F\"ollmer Process'] [Harrem\"oes, Johnson and Kontoyiannis \cite{HJK3}]
