{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:53:11.412887+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c08e0de45fe9b0631ac6d2ba937f4c6dae6fbff16913e93a9cc2c404dded81c3","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Cons 7 of arXiv:2606.08115, '2606.08115'] Suppose for two vectors $\ov{x}, \ov{y} \in K$ that $\ov{x} \le \ov{y}$. Then we have
\begin{equation}

