{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:29:08.706661+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c0c2ce74e08eb59e4b710259dcc18e59a8f364ddb7784e85677cfe324923ee95","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:asymp_miss_prob_infty of arXiv:2412.00279, 'Optimal local storage policy based on stochastic intensities and its large scale behavior'] Suppose that $\int_0^\infty \lambda L(d\lambda)=\infty$. Assume $C/N\to c\in (0,1]$ as $N\to\infty$. Then
