{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:19:46.232237+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c0c550b8da5cbc15bf57f186e37ad28cdf69a6e2f687d12ce72a5dfde1247de7","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 45 of arXiv:2507.08909, 'Annealed almost periodic entropy'] Suppose that $\phi \in \B(\A,\rmM_k)_+$, and let
