{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:57:07.299524+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c1fd52861aeb6d79072e6ec015c62cda0e205489c2aff13b31e44dbe1032482c","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 15 of arXiv:2606.23383, 'Near-Lipschitz stability of the Kim--Milman flow map'] Let $\nu$ satisfy~\eqref{theta}.
