{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:38:13.631158+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c24af679e3f8a48471f7da7ba2970a7c4907840d6e3163d35e30e38a63c707b6","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 13 (\cite{duerinckx2020mean},\,Corollary 3.5) of arXiv:2609.00598, 'Supercritical mean--field limit for magnetized Hamiltonian dynamics'] Suppose that
