{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:56:37.668132+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c25493db80af014f044eea8a236e37e4f49daf9b8d684fbbdb8eff851730b4e8","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop pair of arXiv:2609.00110, 'Phase Transition and Fluctuation Results for First-Passage Percolation on Spread-Out Cycle'] Fix $\varepsilon\in(0,1/2)$ and $y\in\mathds{R}$. Then
\begin{align*}
