{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:42:47.754413+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c2dc9e8cb0c589b0e6b86b37ce9dcabd27eb979c31932887f3f414af66502536","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 31 of arXiv:2604.11682, 'Semilocalization for inhomogeneous random graphs'] We have
