{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:06:55.275061+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c3df7daf7e4c1b1fcf0b6989f6aa2f7082c9da2ded4b11dc070bf1bffcf755d9","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:matrix_azuma of arXiv:2512.21026, 'Minimax Duality in Game-Theoretic Probability\thanks{Work in progress: mistakes are likely'] {tropp2012user}}]

