{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:43:45.389071+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c420270a74e7e46d83274091881388e2779ab7192287977dc177c60bafe5a187","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 16 of arXiv:2609.04139, 'The conformally invariant metric on CLE$_4$ II:\\ existence of geodesics'] For each $r > 0$, write
