{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:53:54.876285+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c4c66da0e029066dcf70c9543995c2d4b4b54eea27751effabd084f979032c03","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 13 of arXiv:2607.17030, 'Stationary measures for log-gamma polymer on a strip and in half-space'] Assume {  $N\in\ZZ_{\geq 1}$},   $\alpha>0$ and $u,v\in\CC$ are such that $\re(u)\not\in\ZZ_{\leq 0}$ and $\re(v)\not\in\ZZ_{\leq 0}$.
