{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:12:19.463871+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c66a701def6b3b0f0989ef16a3efc6bf065e45be5e6b84ade1ce6e0363f15d6b","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 10 (Critical logarithmic estimate) of arXiv:2608.17540, 'Pathwise stability for one-dimensional SDEs driven by Brownian motion and a symmetric stab'] Assume Assumptions~\ref{ass:baseline}--\ref{ass:solutions} and $B,A,S<1$. Suppose $\wt\eta=1/\alpha$ and set
