{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:47:40.734323+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c67603540a98395ed86ef6819f8699a0472b599208f82500b8ffe0dcfdbc04a3","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:heat-kernel-bound of arXiv:2604.20008, 'Mixing times of Langevin dynamics for \\ spiked matrix models'] For any $X_0=x_0\in\mathbf{S}_N$, and any $t\le 1$, we have
