{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:10:07.474569+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c70ae916ed9b713cf0a4c9c34237f8ff04210ea22fbe91c3dfcf69e3d2ea0202","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary eq:theta-large of arXiv:2607.27613, 'Regularized Bulk Universality versus Bounded-Disorder Nonuniversality\\for Annealed Comple'] \label[corollary]{cor:theta-large}
As \(\left\lvertu\right\rvert\to\infty\),
