{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:46:00.349279+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c7dab4ccd8352996c46c3e686c05c9eadb8d4ec248c0f2ce32ceb4f5fe31ce39","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:evamonm of arXiv:2607.19651, 'Metastability and phase transition in a social network model with multiple opinions'] Consider a fixed $o\in \mathcal{O}$.
