(3) $W\in\mathcal{S}$, where W is the distribution of $\sup_{\{0\le n\le N(\tau)\}}\sum_{i=1}^n(Y_i-cZ_i)$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

