{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:05:37.774657+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c9d5e98cd9d2027aa2ca347706ac0762c7504b68e4839753256a99bb40c949ca","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma recursion of arXiv:2608.00399, 'The Heavy-tailed Frog Model'] Let parameters $\gamma$, $\theta$, $\zeta$, and $\eta$ be chosen according to (equation def: epsilon_gamma_zeta of the paper)-(equation def: theta_eta of the paper), and fix $\delta \in (0, 1/2)$. 
