{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:26:52.653677+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c9e9586c6394777ad3e8c957bdf19e4a3201af8b0bc36670d8a8fee696369443","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 2 of arXiv:2609.03669, 'Volterra Integral Reduction \\ for Boundary Diffusion Problems'] The transition density $p(t,x,y)$ of $X_t$ admits the representation
