	\end{flalign*}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:14:46.355626+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c9f1410bf66052923585106f146d3ef5485d1a5f1a637a03de76de68329d7dc2","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem of arXiv:2608.10415, 'Continuous random variables'] The derivatives are subject to the following rules:
