{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:46:55.645320+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cacd459311da02faed65c1e741403d8e3755b4e33e7fc5bd7226c29636a6f727","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 9 (Expected excess risk bound for kTULA) of arXiv:2605.24937, '2605.24937'] Assume \hyperref[ass:PJG]{\textup{(A1)}}--\hyperref[ass:LSI]{\textup{(A6)}}, and let $\lambda\in(0,\lambda_{\max}^{\mathrm{kTULA}}]$. Let $(\widehat X_n)_{n\ge0}$ be the \eqref{eq:kTULA} iterates. Fix $\mu:=\Law(\widehat X_0)$ such that $R_0:=R_2(\mu\|\pi_\beta)<\infty$.
