{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:25:44.992144+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cad22d678b78af862a589c8b1b4b2fee4ed9ee08f8a39f111c46ee20bb9a1bfd","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 3 of arXiv:2605.11801, 'A non-local singular non-linear Fokker-Planck PDE'] Let $f\in \shc^{\g}$ for some $\gamma \in \R$. Then for any $\theta\geq 0$ there exists a constant $c$ such that
