{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:21:45.337874+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cafeb0be1e70983becd02d302f3253558c254110bc3047feaa9d29c7ffd5ebf9","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 26 of arXiv:2607.27150, 'Modelling Anomalous Diffusion: The Role of CTRWs and Non-Local Dynamics'] Let $D$ be regular for $A$, $\mathpzc{l}(D)<+\infty$, and $f\in \BB_b(D)\cap C^2_{loc}(D)$. The problem
		\begin{align}
