{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:32:58.365033+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cd0fa8c909aaaf22e578e8655f68ef5fa01940a3b9244e9f75669d1299d1a90c","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 15 of arXiv:2506.20146, 'Parabolic Anderson Model in the Hyperbolic Space. Part I: Annealed Asymptotics'] There exist constants $C_{1},C_{2}>0,$ such that
\begin{equation}
