\ge
\Pr\mleft(\eta(A)\ge\eta_0\mright)
-\sqbrac{3n\lg\frac{3R}{\eta_0} + 3\lg\frac{2\eta_0}{\tau_0}}
\cdot\frac{\E\vol\Lambda_\varepsilon(A)}{\tau_0\cdot\varepsilon^2}
-\Pr\mleft(\left\|A\right\|>R\mright).}","status":"unverified"}

