{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:06:21.751862+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ce2cd702cbbcd170df79890faaffbbe5ea0e9ccff03f1939c24a2dcc52e7b0e3","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 53 of arXiv:2607.21374, 'Local structure at the maximum and sharp persistence asymptotics of rough fractional Brown'] Put \(\theta:=1-H\).  Then
