{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:05:37.777020+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ce472adc924aa6c958b7694b7b7232b2d1f19c11df7fe736738f7cf839305a5e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma range_estimates of arXiv:2608.00399, 'The Heavy-tailed Frog Model'] Let $Q \in \mathcal{H}_{\alpha, K}$ for some $\alpha, K > 0$. Fix an arbitrary $\varepsilon \in (0, 1)$.
