{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:21:52.488040+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cf66dc7c48410211ed078dd739fb79c4e8f57e4ae2b81f6bcfbc1032bbfad8b7","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 204 of arXiv:2601.16377, '2601.16377'] We introduce four linear operators
