{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:57:51.758476+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cf74f041db51f287178d12d105e874e3ee2b3606a033ea91e0bc49be356a3f07","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 1 of arXiv:2608.30178, '2608.30178'] Assume that \(0<q_1,q_2\le1\).  Then the model
