{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:23:05.305001+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cfda91447391d8addb8bb9ba9915dbbab14ef3eacae2cb50b957396288f2a070","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 12 of arXiv:2608.21905, '\bf Ruin theory incorporating MIPP-type jumps'] For the MIPP $V_t^{(n)}$, the following identity holds:
