{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:49:05.383493+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cfe1119198c31b26e5d33d8ec219ce00244ebc16ec912badab9e1c98b152addd","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary of arXiv:2601.07808, 'Supercritical long-range percolation on graphs of polynomial growth: the truncated one-arm'] \label[corollary]{cor:anchored_isop_dimension}
