{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:26:47.158843+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d072cf02378e163279891c9c7db80d5d1d698a82ad7e82bc4145f88b338c7fde","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 22 (Shape-operator characterization) of arXiv:2608.29406, 'Partially Totally Real Submanifolds of Sasakian Manifolds'] The normal morphism \(F\) is parallel if and only if
