{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:57:49.866155+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d10643d5b826009fef510401a75298dc36f7642cbefa182e988b710ed2d0d5c0","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Cor pant_iter_conv of arXiv:2411.00629, '\Large Transformation of Stochastic Recursions and Critical Phenomena in the Analysis of t'] Let $\mathscr{X}_n(t)$ be the sequence of binary-tree stochastic Picard iterations for (equation pantode of the paper)
