    where $\text{sign}(u) = +1$ if $u\in W$ and $-1$ if $u\in B$ and $X_E(u)$ is the set of $e\in X_E(U)$ incident to the specified vertex $u\in \partial U$ (this can be empty).","status":"unverified"}

