{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:28:33.706256+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d11cabafb4c651c69f106ca1664af294dacd8f685e4bf9e7e6b230c11ff02709","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem l:estXn of arXiv:2504.07255, 'A Tail-Respecting Splitting Numerical Scheme\\ for L\'evy-Driven SDEs With Superlinear Dri'] For any $r\in(0,\infty)$, any $T\in[0,\infty)$, any $N\in\mathbb{N}_0$ and all $k=0,\dots,N$ the following estimate holds:
