{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:17:17.101705+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d2274c5ab6ca44e3b9e5ad7d2c978bf09ad477010ff045d4672426501b832970","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 8 (Campbell--Palm intensity identity) of arXiv:2608.20101, '\bfseries Largest bulk gap of the complex Ginibre ensemble'] For every Borel set \(A\subset D_1\),
