Then, the contact process has a positive probability of survival for sufficiently large $\lambda$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:44:17.167574+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d2423866597debf6b705d06411328d86bdba9e7c015f0e044576ccfb42ba4890","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 8 of arXiv:2604.17973, 'Schauder estimates and classical solutions of the Dirichlet problem for stochastic parabol'] Let $u$ be a quasi-classical solution of \eqref{eq:model-half-space}--\eqref{eq:model-half-space-bc} with $g\equiv0$. Assume that
