{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:51:00.242638+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d3c96b3cd45a2f95138e4ccc17c2a986a0effcb8fd5068ef88a3b38637a51227","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem equiv cv f and G_f and varphi of arXiv:2604.23751, 'Large deviation principles for pattern-avoiding permutations, and limit shapes for constra'] Let $f$ and $f_n$, $n\ge1$, be functions in $\mathcal{F}$.
