{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:26:40.353850+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d5c27cd346798c08b2a9c201da379cbd2e0fb139b8bd8968b979c16941d50ba9","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 41 of arXiv:2511.07350, 'Decoupling of clusters in independent sets in a percolated hypercube'] Recall the definitions of $\Delta$ and $\tilde{\Delta}$ from \eqref{eq:deltadef} above.
