{\mathbb E} \ensuremath{\left\lVert {\bf M} \right\rVert}_{4t}^{4t} ~\leq~ \left((48t|V(\tau)|)^{4t|V(\tau)|} (C|E(\tau)|)^{|E(\tau)|} n^{|V(\tau)|} \right) \left( \sqrt{\frac{1-p}{p}}\right)^{4t|E(S_\tau)|} n^{2t(|V(\tau)| - |S_\tau|)}
$$
where $C$ is an absolute constant and $E(S_\tau)$ are all edges adjacent to $S_\tau$.","status":"unverified"}

