{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:48:35.774068+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d7b55ddb9a5a7b6cf16a2ff307ffc2661f8e7d708d04bb59020b4b2545e488dc","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition of arXiv:2411.09257, 'Iterated Generalized Counting Process and its Extensions'] The L\'evy measure of IGCP is given by
