{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:47:12.026813+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d8a9081ec02a725ae466bfe9ff6ae4d0769ac7a252a24ea672b5678f36834c52","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:reg-fBm of arXiv:2512.06984, 'Infinite Dimensional Multifractal Analysis of the Wiener measure'] Let $ B^H $ be a fractional Brownian motion with Hurst parameter $ H \in (0,1)$. Then
