    where $\gamma_*:=\ln\frac{1-p_0}{p_0(\Delta-2)}$ and $\alpha_*=\frac{1}{2}\log\frac{(\Delta-2)^{\Delta-2}}{p_0(\Delta-1)^{\Delta-1}(1-p_0)^{\Delta-2}}.$","status":"unverified"}

