{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:38:25.227119+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_db814134823ceeb484cc7c2a2d4fb772d0fdf9e4e753746911b492efdfd1fb02","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma higerderiv of arXiv:2609.00627, 'Global well-posedness of radially symmetric strong solutions to two-dimensional compressib'] Assume that (equation TH1. 1-1 of the paper) holds. Then for $q>2$, there exists a constant $C$ depending on $T, q, \mu, \beta, \gamma$,   $\|\boldsymbol{u}_0\|_{H^1}$, $\|\nabla\boldsymbol{d}_0\|_{H^1}$ and $\|\rho_0\|_{W^{1,q}}$ such that
