{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:55:57.002776+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_dbfd483bb98536afcaef3ebff45067d0ee5c9b3f47fcbd14aa51321fc284a326","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 11 of arXiv:2609.02790, 'Full-Model Optimality for Tunable Linear Generative Priors in Compressed Sensing'] Under Lemma \ref{Under_E(k)} assumptions, let $T_2(k)=\Big\|G_k(A_kG_k)^{\dagger}\Big\|_F^2$. For all $ m \leq k$,
