{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:18:19.443322+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_dc070d2a88ed57dab66a1815409211f38b222980d1d4ece67791882e6fd1e534","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:lemma5.5 of arXiv:2508.17838, '\bf Edge Universality for Inhomogeneous Random Matrices'] Set 
