{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:33:21.470797+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_dc80a06ff6f431c105226a55559135f85e8e2ae83e44e455f708e76a752802ce","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defn Definition 4.2 in \cite{AnBaBhPi26} of arXiv:2606.19583, 'Power-law hypothesis and (un)fairness of PageRank on undirected multi-type PAMs'] The characterization of the local limit of the colored directed PAM is as follows: 
