{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:25:49.877465+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_dd0076565ee577e7cd607270a9c255b1dffd6b55cb17fc4f34655ed27a1d1ce3","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 7 of arXiv:2609.02065, '\textbf{From Bowditch's question to Goldman's conjecture for type-preserving representatio'] \cite[Theorem 1.1, Theorem 1.8]{ryu} 
