{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:17:42.301688+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_dd1c3036b991773c14301226592a7cbb891bd395a7a3d0f88e220568b7dfce9c","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 16 of arXiv:2510.22155, 'Random walks in space-time random media in all spatial dimensions: the full subcritical fl'] Let $\mathfrak H^N(t,\cdot)$ be as defined in \eqref{hn} in the introduction. 
