{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:01:01.721861+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_de3347f12968e870ad6318a93df5f21add5db9efec4e2166f68200b75bd88bf3","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:ball-calibration of arXiv:2608.31043, 'Sharp constants for weak estimates of Riesz Potentials when $0<s<\min\{n,2\}$'] $e_R$ belongs to $\dot H^{s/2}(\mathbb{R}^n)$ and
