{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:18:13.255793+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_de4efc889ae6075027c4d334985014fc940228798b6d8c3d28bf97553304ba2a","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary qnform of arXiv:2507.10545, 'KPZ equation from a class of nonlinear SPDEs in infinite volume'] \fsp Retain the setting of Lemma (lemma:mshe of the paper) and Corollary (corollary:mshe of the paper). We have the following for any index {\small$\i=0,1,2$}, which uses notation to be explained afterwards:

\begin{align}
