{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:25:49.875925+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_de5e9bed498be604e0e543c5086c1df47df6ecd3ffdbdebc5da6ff1016e4f442","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 26 (\textsf{Uniform small-diagonal estimate}) of arXiv:2609.02064, 'Coalescence and fluctuations of O'Connell--Yor polymers\\ via the free-energy correlation '] Fix $\wt x\in\R$ and a compact set
