{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:54:34.580457+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_df707d5c69969e775602ddbcf713ad220e0c93ee95c93ca340619abba16fa1bf","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 32 of arXiv:2606.14876, 'High-Order Talagrand and Eldan--Gross Inequalities via Besov-Type Variance Functionals'] Let $a\in[1/2,1]$. Then for all $r\in[0,1]$,
