{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:55:42.128589+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_df75ec03593f15ad2787b3cb8d07ba78483eb46942dd1b955e2a959cad9209bf","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:decomp of arXiv:2411.15954, 'A gradient model for the Bernstein polynomial basis'] For each $n,L\in\mathbb{N}$ with $L>n$, it holds that
    \begin{align}

