{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:04:41.028509+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_dfba698833d413f0839298b5c07415bb2387030ed4f2cfd65745c27fb0cf9333","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma l19b of arXiv:2412.04015, 'Linear fluctuation of interfaces in Glauber-Kawasaki dynamics'] There exists a finite constant ${\mathfrak c}({\boldsymbol u}^N)$ such that 
