{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:48:24.615408+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e0aac0b7f2e898c9a4c0ad14357445c886f4e4e5be92c95fc82223165782ca9d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:main-homog of arXiv:2601.04079, 'TV homogenization inequalities'] For all $\textup{{\bf p}},\textup{{\bf q}}\in[0,1]^n$, we have
