{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:26:40.352314+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e0aaf6be39aae9ddc6e672d7cc31dfd0ee8e5e9f530455653f743c5349fd40d2","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 19 of arXiv:2511.07350, 'Decoupling of clusters in independent sets in a percolated hypercube'] For $p > 0.455$,
