for any $g \in \mathcal{F}$ with ${\mathbb E}\nabla^{(1)}g = 0$ for all $i$ and the quantities $r_0$, $L$, $\sigma$ from Assumptions (ass:Set1 of the paper). Then, for any $t\ge 0$ and any suitable function $f$ such that ${\mathbb E} f = 0$, it holds that
        \[
