{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:54:57.593866+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e0f037e8e600858cc3385bcdb14c32a673fb9f556674931ac47d047855180429","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem A.1 of arXiv:2412.03370, 'TASEP with a general initial condition and a deterministically moving wall'] As claimed in the proof of Lemma~(lem:6.3 of the paper), 
