{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:45:32.074950+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e15f747f6151becb510ad01aeb2c3cbc5ac867261c45612280e6da8ee9089e4c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm t1-tightening of arXiv:2411.14236, 'Size of chaos for Gibbs measures\\of mean field interacting diffusions'] Let $\mu \in \mathcal P_1(\mathcal X)$
