     where  $\mathsf U:=\iota( \mathsf{Q})$,  $\mathsf{P}_t:= \mathsf{gap}^{-1}\left((T_t)_{\#}\mathsf U\right)$ and $f$ is chosen as in (equation eq:function_f of the paper).","status":"unverified"}

