{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:33:01.761100+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e36f4da88e854bda0e2790ce2a9fd3d253168c4ff91a75480ab84bdef94e3d90","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 17 of arXiv:2605.14254, '2605.14254'] For any filtration $\mathcal{F}$, these conditions are equivalent:
