{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:26:26.760520+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e479507bdf1a6678669f63df216f21d9e8478b7b8f9668a86512174fadd49b94","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:HSEP-seed-linear of arXiv:2608.02772, 'Non-Abelian Hirota-Miwa Equations for the KPZ Universality Class'] The seed functions $\Psi$ and $\Phi$ satisfy the linear
problem (equation eq:Linear-Psi-3 of the paper) and adjoint linear
problem (equation eq:Linear-Phi-Prob of the paper) on $\mathcal{V}$
