{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:28:34.925045+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e5099c54351c3e245d1fc0e74f8899e0828285434e9264ae66b3244874ddfd44","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemma_BKR of arXiv:2412.05706, 'Quasi-multiplicativity and regularity for metric graph Gaussian free fields'] If events $\mathsf{A}_1,\mathsf{A}_2,...,\mathsf{A}_j$ ($j\ge 2$) are connecting events, then we have
