{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:04:39.219704+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e65730c73bb9b027f0d14b81721b02a78b4156c0e57220cde1266360a797a638","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defn 3 of arXiv:2608.13976, 'Boundary Harnack principle for diffusion with jumps on metric measure spaces'] \begin{enumerate}
 \item[\rm (i)]
