{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:47:32.863205+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e6ff49500572cbcef8aab0055198b59f30253faeb91ade56d894f90cd434e920","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 5 (\cite{10}) of arXiv:2609.02426, 'Deformations of the $\osp(n|2)$-action on the superspace\\ of symbols of differential oper'] For $n\geq3$,
\begin{equation}

\Hd^1_{\mathrm{diff}}\bigl(\osp(n|2),\Dc^n_{\lambda,\mu}\bigr)\simeq
\begin{cases}
\R & \text{if }\mu-\lambda=0,\\[2pt]
\R^2 & \text{if }(\lambda,\mu)=\bigl(-\frac{k+n-2}{2},\frac{k}{2}\bigr),\ k\in\N\setminus\{0\},\\[2pt]
0 & \text{otherwise},
\end{cases}
\end{equation}
the corresponding cohomology classes being spanned by the $1$-cocycles
\begin{align}
f_\lambda(X_F)&=F',\\
