{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:47:21.632971+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e702a4bf38a7464e2a54189e82b930e36e12ef6d83d4c58869088a52ccf130c5","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:NE-conditions2 of arXiv:2412.09087, 'General Markovian randomized equilibrium existence and construction in zero-sum Dynkin gam'] Consider the following conditions.
\begin{enumerate}[(i)]
