    \end{equs}
    \end{enumerate}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:25:40.048760+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e7f4c7e46b71bc80ef93124c0de438a325839f30179701d5f6da2811c71e46a7","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Pro 1 (Kemeny \cite{KS76}) of arXiv:2510.26207, 'A combinatorial perspective on the Kemeny constant and more'] The values $\l(Q^{\geq 1}(u), u \in V\r)$
