 with $\upsilon_0>0$ given in \eqref{notation} and $\upsilon_i\in\R\backslash\{0\}$ for $i=1,2,3$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:26:52.665925+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e88d686c6c68c1096230d6aabc9fc439cd19d675b3129e42e5a6635ecc71874d","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 15 of arXiv:2609.03736, '2609.03736'] Let $K,L\in M_m(\CC)$ satisfy
