\] (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:43:45.387974+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e92c012e9812dada1197b947141d65bc6ab9c2583a6eba5364df6ae68cff7732","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 4 (Behavior of geodesics) of arXiv:2609.04139, 'The conformally invariant metric on CLE$_4$ II:\\ existence of geodesics'] Let $D$ be a weak geodesic CLE$_4$ metric coupling in the sense of \Cref{def:weak_axioms}. Let $U \subsetneq \BC$ be a deterministic simply connected domain. Then:
