{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:29:27.958508+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e9c440e2c9bf68371a00a1509e2b899b33f6e74c87f25a9c5841eb8d6a0cd5f7","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 11 of arXiv:2608.24675, 'Towards Liouville Quantum Gravity on fractals'] Let $|\gamma|<\sqrt{d_H/C_0}$. For any $u\in C_b(K)$, the sequence $\{\nu_{\ell}^\gamma(u)\}_{\ell\geq 1}$ given by
