{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:51:52.125735+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e9de124fa881a46b0b905c569ffe3f45328f7ce4418d10f2859088824d96a99a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma L:arc-level-atomization of arXiv:2607.15966, 'Canonical Mandelbrot Cascades on Curves Are Rajchman'] Fix \(K_1\geq1\) and \(h\in\mathbb{N}_0\).  
