\end{equation}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:26:20.651635+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ea3a90d8f4854905d9dc3057a3a39ddd6ae7086f2d0efe6a9d8d6f47b7ba07c6","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:lemma2-1 of arXiv:2411.12076, 'Explicit solutions of the SI and Bass models on sparse Erd\H{o}s-R\'enyi and regular netwo'] Let
