\item[ii.] we have $\rm{rank}\,\pi(a) \le \rm{rank}\,\rho(a)$ for every $a\in \A$;
\item[iii.] there is a representation $\pi_1$ such that $\pi \oplus \pi_1 \simeq_{\rm{a}} \rho$.
