{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:43:00.038115+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ec6386de063d99d9de3e8ed25075c8ead7c7e87e71737454eb7a23cfe39b804c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 20 of arXiv:2609.00739, '2609.00739'] Let
\[
 Z(r):=\zetastar^a(B_r),
