\|\bbone_{Q_1}u^+\cI_t\|_{\mL^\infty}+\|\bbone_{Q_1}\nn_vu^+\cI_t\|_{\mL^2}\lesssim_C\|\bbone_{Q_2}u^+\cI_t\|_{\mL^2}+\|\bbone_{Q_2}f\cI_t\|_{\mL_t^{q_0}\mL_z^{\bbp_0}}.
