Here $C>0$ depends only on $d,q_1,\bbp_1,q_0,\bbp_0,\b$ and $\|b\|_{\mL_t^{q_1}\mL_z^{\bbp_1}((-4,4)\times\mR^{2d})}$.","status":"unverified"}

