{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:01:25.573522+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_edc2a8afe70126acec5c2180501d4fabe69dad9f2b7aa16deffea0f2e9eb85c0","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemma-properties-weight of arXiv:2605.15742, 'Turbulent stretching of FENE dumbbell polymer model via special stochastic scaling and sin'] Let $\kappa> 2$ and $d_{\partial D}(x) := 1-|x|^2$ denotes the distance from $\partial D$.  We have:
    \begin{enumerate}
