{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:56:49.280283+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ee1364c692b3da481c8d94043ac29d0d0ecf3c040070f80eb5639c02d5d546fe","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 13 of arXiv:2606.22611, 'Upper and Lower Bounds on Expected Soft Maxima\\of Gaussian Processes'] Let $T$ be a finite set and let ${\mathbb G}$ be a finite group acting transitively on $T$. Let $f$ be a concave functional
