{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:24:20.646499+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ef60437569955b0cafab73682284a0afe085cc3a57d816eb907989ea1073feed","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:subgaussian-directional-tensor-moments of arXiv:2608.11084, 'Sharp Frobenius-Norm Concentration for Sample Moment Tensors'] Let \(X\in\mathbb R^d\) be a centered sub-Gaussian random vector with
