{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:54:10.965436+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ef7c147401d0ea647ca9127019bb6d3183ae836eafe0de0211bd48ee5f4988bf","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 16 of arXiv:2606.12720, 'On McDiarmid's Inequality under Dependence \\ via Approximate Tensorization of Entropy'] {ATE from Entropy Conservation}


