{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:07:56.650706+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f1c86b4c4543ccac9c9b97c769aa458d4223d99686c0e6768a400e4f74a423fa","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma malliavin_2 of arXiv:2411.04590, 'Singular stochastic delay equations driven by fractional Brownian motion: Dynamics, longti'] For $\tau \in (-\infty,\sigma)$, we have
