{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:47:40.728888+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f1d6d43eb74c7d0a25e2eba38210c14711e6520dd68022bc41fb35384c4b09d9","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:OU-estimate of arXiv:2604.20008, 'Mixing times of Langevin dynamics for \\ spiked matrix models'] Let $Y_t$ solve~(equation eq:Y_t-OU of the paper)
