V_{A^{\rm gen, +}_{m-1}}^{k}
\psi^{\rm gen}_{n-2k,m}
\Big\Vert_{H^{-\eta}(\C)}^{2}
\Big]
=
\\
\sum_{j=0}^{+\infty}
\E\Big[
\Big\Vert
\sum_{0\leq k< \lfloor n/2\rfloor}
(-1)^{k} \dfrac{n!}{2^{k} k! (n-2k)!}
V_{A^{\rm gen}_{m}}^{k}\psi_{n-2k,m,j}
\Big)
\Big\Vert_{H^{-\eta}(\C)}^{2}
