{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:12:20.558956+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f40bcaf1a844e19aa3e68ba3c06e2ebd485234b7a9ece10c1315c1f23ec17c64","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Question of arXiv:2604.04882, 'On a Problem of M. Kac on Laplace Distributions'] Is $L(s)=e^{-s}$ characterized among completely monotone functions by the following rigidity property: if
