{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:32:28.957095+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f576e8f61be1f347edd93cd3fa84eb9be3979da07509dff047ead49c4c0dc176","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:shortcut-limit of arXiv:2608.23135, 'Graph distance and effective resistance of the random walk trace in four and five dimensio'] For every fixed $\varepsilon\in(0,1)$,
