    \bE[XY]=0.
\end{equation}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:26:52.683122+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f7613a69f39cafe547d08099863cb306c07635e10d01e866e16a8dcd772abf7e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 14 of arXiv:2609.03777, '2609.03777'] Let $k\geq3$. For $\tau\in C$ and $R>0$, we have
