{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:24:47.653825+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f76405d63340d29edb38e48eb1fec4f20caaf847cb330d6cbf85f54ec60229d6","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 7 of arXiv:2605.07184, 'Convergence of Stochastic Gradient Descent with mini-batching and infinite variance'] Under the assumptions of \Cref{th:averaging_stable_convergence},
