{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:07:56.655014+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f766ef06669abaffdb404bebb5d46ebb4777cbdd8beb2ffa6e451d4a50b11ebe","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem Important Estimates of arXiv:2411.04631, 'Existence of Martingale Solutions to Stochastic Constrained Heat Equation'] Suppose $u_{n}(t)$ solves (equation faedo after Qn of the paper) then\\
