{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:07:48.554910+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f780812155c267b0109541d65e0e1f016dd3c82fe10749ff5fdd65196f54f2d4","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 9 (Cai--Lu strong-convergence criterion) of arXiv:2609.01436, '2609.01436'] Suppose $N_c>0$, and let
