{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:57:59.894363+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f811c15c7d7f2a7a8988e469bb0a4f4430f58a14642a68f31eb2d92134fcefe7","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Probyauconjecture probYauconj of arXiv:2607.09946, 'Statistics on Yau's conjecture: Variance asymptotics'] Choose a compact Riemannian manifold $(M,g)$ and a bounded interval $I$ with average frequency $\lambda(\phi_I^M)$. 
