{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:23:03.043464+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f840e6cf8780893ce68f594b2d5caba31afab887b17bf4f4a6f3db9ec85a0e58","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 72 of arXiv:2605.03236, 'Stochastic It\^o Equations and Parabolic Second-Order Equations with singular Drift'] For any $p\geq d_{0}+1$  
