{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:06:21.667359+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f91563696ff053346e897ebf7dfa6fdcc17abee99f67b37c600057483a494df5","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 8 (Information flow associated with coordinate $i$) of arXiv:2607.20823, 'Fluctuation impossibility results for stochastic burst networks'] Assuming that the series below is absolutely convergent, define
