{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:10:08.727309+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f9d9a8be02283e7773aa1b71c5d023a725cd96ece6c1a230554c67e46e2a35a1","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma rate_function_rel_entropy of arXiv:2411.17653, 'Exclusion processes with non-reversible boundary: hydrodynamics and large deviations'] For each continuous function $\gamma:[0,1]\to[0,1]$ and each smooth function $G\in C^{1,2}( {\Omega_T})$
