{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:39:12.186135+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fbe216fb9ba3dc5d4deaaa8fef9557b1b3d3d9e2028bf66c129ae17473681b89","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary mallows_permuton_limit of arXiv:2412.07258, 'Permuton limit of a generalization of the Mallows and $k$-card-minimum models'] $ $
