{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:59:24.054623+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ffcb5fe5de2c992129dfec2fb679edc55b2b2fe12e840eab22ee9dc59a277ea3","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:cone-Jacobi of arXiv:2608.30904, 'Entire monotone solutions of the anisotropic Allen--Cahn equation in dimension 5'] With respect to the coordinates $(t,q)\in\mathbb R\times\Lambda$,
