{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:23:37.816277+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ffceaa3befffdd5fd07c10f3a347915f047ffc686f3c0691e8526650b44d2caa","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 8 of arXiv:2609.03634, 'Joint Laws of Maximum Drawdown and Maximum Drawup for Spectrally Negative L\'{e}vy Process'] For \(a<0<b\),
